OL,3,GNEWSA'Strong and brave' heritage
OL,4,Arailway chairman dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to the chairman
OL,7,Fof the country's longest heritage
OL,8,Frailway, who has passed away at the age
OL,9,Fof 42.
OL,11,FJonathan Jones-Pratt ran the West
OL,12,FSomerset Railway since 2019 and is
OL,13,Fcredited by the company with guiding it
OL,14,Fthrough a "challenging" period.
OL,16,FHis partner, Hollie Bowden said she was
OL,17,F"utterly heartbroken and shattered" by
OL,18,Fhis sudden death after a short illness.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
